            "commentDate": "2024-07-12T12:25:02.7495267",
            "htmlComment": "<p>هیچ ارتباطی با این ضرب&zwnj;المثل نداره!</p>",
            "publishStatus": "",
            "inReplyToId": 94365,
            "userId": "fdd647e7-6534-4ded-89f9-08dc595893ff",
            "replies": [
